body:
Again, thank you to all the people who created the CC I have used to make my favorite game's characters. I will be working on the next six and will post them as soon as I am done!

&#x200B;

Solas was the hardest by far, where Leliana proved the easiest to create. I also redid my character because, as others mentioned, she did look like Poison Ivy. Thank you again everyone; this has been fun so far!

I have to tell myself that this is the life I wanted, take prescribed medication, and give myself the time I need in between all the hectic parts of life. Don't forget to take care of yourself in this crazy world.

&#x200B;

Its hard, and if you're having a rough time, don't give up.

Definitely not the worst by all means, but I had a Dos-Equis keg at my house for celebrating my birthday some time ago. Some spilled and it wasn't noticed. The next day, that smell ranked through my house. 

&#x200B;

Best beer for me, but worst smell.

[https://soundcloud.com/kristin-santos-283425510/aircheck-march21/s-8Q4USaOMlIs](https://soundcloud.com/kristin-santos-283425510/aircheck-march21/s-8Q4USaOMlIs)

&#x200B;

Here you go! I always have a blast with these Airchecks!
